                    "note_model_uuid": "3a9fd11a-cd92-11f1-9564-7dad70bd0806",
                    "tags": []
                },
                {
                    "__type__": "Note",
                    "fields": [
                        "<div>Name a major advantage of using frequency-domain techniques for the\nsolution of the response.</div>",
                        "Pole-zero concepts give one an intuitive feel for the problem.",
